---
// Terms of use for the website. Deliberately says nothing about deposits or cancellation fees:
// those are the studio's appointment policies, explained at booking, and must not be invented here.
import LegalPage from "../layouts/LegalPage.astro";
import { getSiteSettings } from "../lib/content";

const settings = await getSiteSettings();
const updated = "November 13, 2026";
---

<LegalPage
  title="Terms of Use"
  heading="Terms of use."
  lede="The ground rules for using this website. Your appointment itself is covered by the consultation and consent you agree with Pomi in the studio."
  description={`Terms of use for the ${settings.businessName} website.`}
  path="/terms"
  updated={`Last updated ${updated}`}
>
  <h2 id="info">Information, not medical advice</h2>
  <p>
    The guides on this website explain permanent makeup in general terms. They are not medical advice and do not replace a
    consultation. Whether a treatment is right for you, and how it is done, is decided with Pomi at your appointment. If you
    have a medical condition, are pregnant or nursing, or take medication, please check with your doctor first.
  </p>

  <h2 id="results">Results vary</h2>
  <p>
    The photos show real work by Pomi on real clients. Every person's skin heals differently, and results depend on skin
    type, health, aftercare and lifestyle, so your result will be your own. Healed photos are labeled where we know how
    long after the treatment they were taken.
  </p>

  <h2 id="prices">Prices and booking</h2>
  <p>
    Prices on this website are a guide and may change. The price for your treatment is confirmed before your appointment.
    Sending the appointment form is a request, not a booking; your appointment is confirmed once Pomi calls or texts you
    back. Deposits, rescheduling and cancellation are explained when you book.
  </p>

  <h2 id="content">Photos and words</h2>
  <p>
    The photos, text and logo on this website belong to {settings.businessName}. Client photos are shown with permission.
    Please don't copy or reuse them without asking us first. Sharing a link to a page is always welcome.
  </p>

  <h2 id="reviews">Reviews</h2>
  <p>Reviews quoted on this website come from Yelp and are shown as written.</p>

  <h2 id="links">Other websites</h2>
  <p>
    Links to Instagram, Yelp, Google and other websites are there for your convenience. We are not responsible for their
    content or how they handle your information.
  </p>

  <h2 id="liability">The website itself</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep this website accurate and available, but it is provided as it is, without guarantees that it will always
    be complete, current or uninterrupted. To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for losses that come from using
    the website. Nothing here limits rights you have under California law that cannot be limited.
  </p>

  <h2 id="law">Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of California.</p>

  <h2 id="changes">Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. The date at the top shows when they last changed.</p>

  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <address>
    {settings.businessName}<br />
    {settings.street}<br />
    {settings.city}, {settings.state} {settings.zip}<br />
    <a href={`tel:${settings.phoneTel}`}>{settings.phone}</a>
  </address>
</LegalPage>
